BT /F2 22 Tf 72 720 Td (Skylark WS-3 Home Weather Station) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 683 Td (This manual explains how to set up, use and look after the Skylark WS-3. The station has) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 668 Td (an outdoor sensor that measures temperature, humidity, wind and rain, and an indoor) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 653 Td (display that shows the readings and sounds the alarms. Read each section before you) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 638 Td (start, and keep the manual near the display.) Tj ET
BT /F2 17 Tf 72 606 Td (1 Getting started) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 72 567 Td (1.1 What is in the box) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 539 Td (The box holds the outdoor sensor, the indoor display, a mounting pole in two parts, four) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 524 Td (screws with wall plugs, a set of bird spikes, a USB cable and a small brush for the rain) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 509 Td (funnel. Batteries are not included.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 72 477 Td (1.2 Choosing a place) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 449 Td (Where you put the two parts decides how good the readings are and how well they talk to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 434 Td (each other. Choose both places before you drill any holes.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 402 Td (1.2.1 Outdoor sensor) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 376 Td (Mount the outdoor sensor at least 1.5 metres above the ground, on a pole or post away) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 361 Td (from walls and trees. A wall that faces the sun warms the air around it and makes the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 346 Td (temperature read high, and a tree shelters the wind cups.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 314 Td (1.2.2 Indoor display) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 288 Td (Place the indoor display within 100 metres of the sensor in open air, or within 30) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 273 Td (metres when there are walls between them. Keep it at least one metre away from a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 258 Td (television, a microwave oven or a wireless router, which can block the signal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 224 Td (WARNING: Never mount the outdoor sensor during a storm, and never climb a ladder in high wind.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 211 Td (Keep the mounting pole at least 3 metres away from overhead power lines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 760 Td (Skylark WS-3 Home Weather Station: User Manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 40 Td (Page 1 of 7) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
