BT /F2 14 Tf 72 720 Td (3.1 Calibrating the readings) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 692 Td (The station is checked before it leaves the factory, but your site may still differ a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 677 Td (little from a nearby weather report. Two readings can be adjusted.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 645 Td (3.1.1 Pressure) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 619 Td (To match your local weather report, open the settings, go to Pressure offset, and add or) Tj ET
