BT /F1 11 Tf 72 589 Td (it shows.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 557 Td (3.1.2 Rain) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 531 Td (If the rain total reads too low next to a standard rain gauge, first check that the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 516 Td (funnel is level. The rain factor can be set from 0.8 to 1.2 in steps of 0.05, and every) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 501 Td (rain reading is multiplied by it.) Tj ET
