BT /F2 13 Tf 72 433 Td (5.2.1 Temperature too high) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 407 Td (A temperature that reads several degrees too high on sunny afternoons usually means the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 392 Td (sensor gets direct sun or heat from a wall. Move it into open air, and check that the) Tj ET
