BT /F2 14 Tf 72 681 Td (6.1 Specifications) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 645 Td (6.1.1 Measuring ranges) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 619 Td (The outdoor sensor measures temperature from minus 40 to 60 degrees Celsius, humidity) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 604 Td (from 1 to 99 percent, and wind speed up to 180 kilometres an hour.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 572 Td (6.1.2 Radio) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 546 Td (The sensor sends a new set of readings every 48 seconds on the 868 MHz band, which) Tj ET
